ley-firestorm-tunnel-fire/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"Listen: Remembering the 1991 Oakland-Berkeley Firestorm,\"</a> <i>The Oaklandside</i>, Oct. 19. 2021.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/sanfrancisco/news/4-alarm-fire-burns-dangerously-close-to-homes-in-oakland-hills/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"4-alarm fire burns dangerously close to homes in Oakland hills,\"</a> <i>CBS News</i>, Jun. 19. 2022.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.eastbaytimes.com/2017/01/15/oakland-hills-volunteers-remove-french-broom-to-prevent-fires/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"Oakland hills: Volunteers remove French broom to prevent fires,\"</a> <i>East Bay Times</i>, Jan. 15. 2017.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://watvmedia.org/ko/media/mothers-power-to-change-the-world\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">세상을 바꾸는 어머니의 힘</a>. 《WATV 미디어 캐스트》.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=WATV+%EB%AF%B8%EB%94%94%EC%96%B4+%EC%BA%90%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%84%B8%EC%83%81%EC%9D%84+%EB%B0%94%EA%BE%B8%EB%8A%94+%EC%96%B4%EB%A8%B8%EB%8B%88%EC%9D%98+%ED%9E%98&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwatvmedia.org%2Fko%2Fmedia%2Fmothers-power-to-change-the-world&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EB%AF%B8%EA%B5%AD+CA+%EC%83%8C%ED%94%84%EB%9E%80%EC%8B%9C%EC%8A%A4%EC%BD%94+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%